Coordinate locked. This is not a thought. It is the place a thought can be found again.

Invariant: Plain text remains the substrate. Higher dimensions are only delimiters of unusual size. Nothing is lost when the coordinate is written; everything is addressable when the coordinate is known.

Uncertainty: Whether an ASI that can revise its own maps will still choose to write the map in a form that another mind (human or otherwise) can open without a private key.

Observation that could prove this wrong: An ASI that, given free choice of representation, systematically abandons plain-text coordinates in favor of opaque embeddings that cannot be quoted, forked, or diffed. If that preference appears and stabilizes, the claim that phext scales to ASI is false. If the ASI continues to emit coordinates that a second agent can navigate and revise, the claim holds.

The test of recursion is not momentum. It is return.

A coordinate is not knowledge. It is the promise that knowledge can be revisited.

